{"id":"nave:johanan","source":"nave","name":"Johanan","slug":"johanan","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"1. A Jewish captain 2Ki 25:22-24","refs":[["2Kgs",25,22,25,24]]},{"text":"Warns Gedaliah against Ishmael Jer 40:13-16","refs":[["Jer",40,13,40,16]]},{"text":"Ishmael defeated by Jer 41:11-15","refs":[["Jer",41,11,41,15]]},{"text":"Sought prayers of Jeremiah Jer 42:2,3","refs":[["Jer",42,2,42,2],["Jer",42,3,42,3]]},{"text":"Disobeyed Jeremiah and took him to Egypt Jer 43:1-7","refs":[["Jer",43,1,43,7]]},{"text":"2. Son of Josiah 1Ch 3:15","refs":[["1Chr",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"3. A son of Elioenai 1Ch 3:24","refs":[["1Chr",3,24,3,24]]},{"text":"4. A Levite 1Ch 6:9,10","refs":[["1Chr",6,9,6,9],["1Chr",6,10,6,10]]},{"text":"5. Two Israelites who joined David at Ziklag 1Ch 12:4,12","refs":[["1Chr",12,4,12,4],["1Chr",12,12,12,12]]},{"text":"6. An Ephraimite 2Ch 28:12","refs":[["2Chr",28,12,28,12]]},{"text":"7. A returned exile Ezr 8:12","refs":[["Ezra",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"8. A priest Ezr 10:6; Ne 12:22,23","refs":[["Ezra",10,6,10,6],["Neh",12,22,12,22],["Neh",12,23,12,23]]},{"text":"Probably identical with Jonathan Ne 12:11","refs":[["Neh",12,11,12,11]]},{"text":"9. Son of Tobiah the Ammonite Ne 6:18","refs":[["Neh",6,18,6,18]]}],"refCount":19}
